statusOf.t.sol
├── given the subscription is not registered
│   └── it should return {Null}
└── given the subscription is registered
    ├── given the subscription is revoked
    │   └── it should return {Revoked}
    └── given the subscription is not revoked
        ├── given all cycles have been charged
        │   ├── it should return {Expired}
        │   └── given the cycles were charged as a catch-up
        │       └── it should still return {Expired}
        └── given not all cycles have been charged
            ├── given more cycles have started than have been charged
            │   └── it should return {PastDue}
            └── given the charged count keeps pace with the started cycles
                └── it should return {Active}
